    "longDescription": "Why download Smart Clean Pro? Smart Clean Pro is a practical cleaning app with multiple functions: clean up log files, APK files, audio files, and video files.\n\nCore Features:\n🗑️ Scan and clean up log files on your Android phone；\n📄 Finds outdated APK files and chooses whether to clean them;\n🎵 Scan and manually choose whether to delete files—like audio and video.\n\nOther Useful Features:\n📸 Compresses images without affecting quality;\n🔇 Blocks unnecessary notifications to block unnecessary messages;\n📱 Features a beautiful interface and easy-to-understand operation.\n\nExperience practical cleaning that brings you more comprehensive cleaning features.",
